---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="FintechAcademy" description="A knowledge base for understanding how money moves.">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-4" style="color: var(--color-copper);">
        A Payments Knowledge Base
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-heading font-semibold leading-tight mb-6" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
        Understand how<br />
        <span style="color: var(--color-copper);">money moves.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-2xl" style="color: var(--color-stone);">
        FintechAcademy is a free, open knowledge base that explains the systems
        behind every payment &mdash; from the moment you tap your card to the
        settlement between banks.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Divider -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <hr style="border-color: var(--color-parchment); margin: 0;" />
  </div>

  <!-- Featured Topics Preview -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-8" style="color: var(--color-stone-light);">
      Start Exploring
    </h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <a href="/topics" class="topic-card group">
        <span class="topic-number">01</span>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-copper)] transition-colors">
          Card Networks
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-stone);">
          How Visa, Mastercard, and others route billions of transactions every day.
        </p>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <a href="/topics" class="topic-card group">
        <span class="topic-number">02</span>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-copper)] transition-colors">
          Payment Rails
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-stone);">
          ACH, wire transfers, SWIFT &mdash; the infrastructure that moves money between accounts.
        </p>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <a href="/topics" class="topic-card group">
        <span class="topic-number">03</span>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-copper)] transition-colors">
          Digital Wallets
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-stone);">
          Apple Pay, Google Pay, and the tokenization technology that powers them.
        </p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Sample prose section to test typography -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-none prose prose-lg mx-auto" style="max-width: 70ch;">
      <h2>What happens when you tap your card?</h2>
      <p>
        In the fraction of a second between tapping your card and seeing
        "Approved" on the terminal, a remarkable chain of events unfolds.
        Your payment traverses multiple networks, passes through several
        institutions, and triggers a series of risk checks &mdash; all before
        you've even put your wallet away.
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        <p>
          "The payments industry moves trillions of dollars daily through
          infrastructure most people never think about."
        </p>
      </blockquote>
      <p>
        Understanding these systems isn't just for engineers or bankers.
        Whether you're building a fintech product, running a business that
        accepts payments, or simply curious about the financial plumbing of
        modern commerce &mdash; this knowledge matters.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .topic-card {
    display: block;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-parchment);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background-color: var(--color-ivory);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .topic-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-copper-light);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(184, 115, 51, 0.06);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .topic-number {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-copper);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .topic-card {
      background-color: var(--color-night-surface);
      border-color: var(--color-night-elevated);
    }

    .topic-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-night-copper);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(212, 149, 90, 0.08);
    }
  }
</style>
